From 8fcd61cefc42c4e003ca0e9520973277ac2a77a8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Till Heinzerling <till.heinzerling1@vodafone.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 15:36:10 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] virtual-media: assign and validate USB controllers

Allow each mount point to request an explicit UDC and let the configuration
reserve controllers used by other gadget owners. Determine runtime occupancy
from configfs UDC bindings instead of the obsolete usb-vhub suspended path,
reject unavailable or duplicate assignments, and cover reservation, busy,
simultaneous-slot, teardown, and reuse behavior with unit tests.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Till Heinzerling <1684934+hoinzy@users.noreply.github.com>

